abstract: "Extended methods and supplementary results (Ae. aegypti ovitrap model, imported dengue cases model, and integrated risk map) for the manuscript 'Risk Map of Dengue Transmission in the Metropolitan Area of Mexico City'. Rendered Quarto document (HTML). Confirmed dengue case data are not distributed."
